Float - A floating point number in python and other programming languages is a number with a decimal point.

num1 = int(input("First Number: "))
num2 = float(input("Second Number: "))
total = num1 + num2
print("Sum: ", total)

num1 = input("First Number: ")
num2 = input("Second Number: ")
sum = float(num1) + int(num2)
print("Sum: ", sum)

